<title>USA: Waban files early proxy materials on BJs.</title>
<headline>Waban files early proxy materials on BJs.</headline>
<dateline>NATICK, Mass. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waban Inc said it filed preliminary proxy materials with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission in connection with its planned spinoff of BJ's Wholesale Club to its shareholders.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to mail definitive proxy materials to its stockholders after the SEC completes its review of the documents.</p>
